          "id": "bdd1e73ea37b570bd45e2259f1494c5028d531a3",
          "message": "fix: make sure the query planner grpc tests also run check (#3057)\n\n## Description\n\nIn refactoring the integration tests, we stopped running the query\nplanner check tests. They still pass, fortunately, but now they're\nproperly enabled.\n\nWhile we're here, restructure the tests to be easier on the eyes.\nInstead of\n`TestQueryPlanConsistencyGRPC/allopscaveat.yaml/v1/qp_lookup_resources_document_reader/user:always`\nhave\n\n`TestQueryPlanConsistencyGRPC/allopscaveat.yaml/v1/lookup_resources/document_reader/user:always`",
