          "id": "259732a2fa5bea7d2fab4a409fb532cdb25733bc",
          "message": "chore: add cyclic tests to query planner (#3075)\n\n## Description\nRelated to #3070. In talking with @barakmich, the Query Planner\nshouldn't need cycle debugging behavior because the implementation of\nthe Recursive iterator prevents infinite looping. This verifies that\nwith a small set of integration-ish tests that would have failed under\nthe old logic.\n\n## Changes\n* Add three new tests\n\n\n## Testing\nReview. Make sure that the tests test what I think they're testing.",
