          "id": "719e60716fd16a78de774c30571ed189e5705cb4",
          "message": "feat: add a DispatchExecutor for query plans to the dispatch package (#3074)\n\n## Description\n\nImplement a DispatchExecutor inside of the dispatch package. It is an\nimplementation of the query.Executor interface targeted at running\nsubproblems of a query plan through dispatch (using the new\nDispatchQueryPlan api). In this initial implementation, it only\ndispatches at Alias boundaries.\n\n## Testing\n\nBenchmarks and testing included",
