          "id": "ee7c9a7c93a3ae75fdc9a5d9a30d3f6511cc479a",
          "message": "refactor: wire QueryPlanMetadata through dispatch as well (#3096)\n\n## Description\n\nDispatchQueryPlan rebuilds the query on the receiving side, but does not\ncollect statistics while doing so. It should share the statistics with\nthe root server metadata. This refactor moves the QueryPlanMetadata into\npkg/query to avoid import cycles and then uses the same instantiated\nstruct throughout the server layer.",
