          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6f3a955a1f858cdc05a3097bdbda3db245b35873",
          "message": "refactor: carry schema hash inside ZedTokens (#3125)\n\nAdds bytes schema_hash to `V1ZedToken`. The consistency middleware now\npropagates the real hash from the token on at-exact-snapshot and\nzedtoken-wins at-least-as-fresh paths, instead of substituting a bypass\nsentinel. `RevisionFromContext` emits new tokens carrying the hash.\n\n`DecodeRevision` now returns a `DecodedRevision` struct `(Revision,\nSchemaHash, Status)` for readability.\n\n`RemoteClockRevisions.CheckRevision` gains a separate `nowOnlyFunc` that\nskips the schema_revision subquery; CRDB and Spanner each register a\ntimestamp-only variant. Datastores that don't register `nowOnlyFunc`\nfall back to nowFunc, preserving prior behavior.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-21T16:53:05-07:00",
          "tree_id": "7ac546b11c8c79b534c6e0737bad1c6784ec7051",
          "url": "https://github.com/authzed/spicedb/commit/6f3a955a1f858cdc05a3097bdbda3db245b35873"
