          "id": "af55756f28557ecc5059e8724aff98abfe2a939b",
          "message": "otel: replace cobraotel with native lifecycle management (#3108)\n\n## Description\n\nCloses https://github.com/authzed/spicedb/issues/3095 and\nhttps://github.com/authzed/spicedb/issues/712\n\n## Testing\n\n1. `docker-compose up --build`, then send a few requests to the server\nand go to localhost:3000. You should be able to see traces\n2. shutdown the docker containers. You should see this log: \"shutting\ndown OTel provider\"\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Maria Ines Parnisari <maria.ines.parnisari@authzed.com>",
