          "message": "chore: use StopAllGoroutines for otter (#3145)\n\n## Description\nI found\n[this](https://github.com/maypok86/otter/blob/8c526307556486ea0337280a4211135720bc29cc/cache.go#L468-L479)\nwhile looking around in issues and PRs for otter. This is a better\nsolution than ignoring the goroutines.\n\n## Changes\n* Use StopAllGoroutines\n* Get rid of ignores\n## Testing\nReview. See that tests pass.",
