          "id": "221681b35ad4ecf820868256c27736cf11c6884f",
          "message": "docs(cache): clarify Cache interface semantics (#3152)\n\nResolves #3137.\n\nDocuments the Ristretto-modeled contract for the `Cache` interface (per\nmaintainer guidance in the issue) and notes where the current\nOtter-backed implementation differs — answering the three questions\nraised about `Set` overwrite behavior, `cost` semantics, and whether\n`Wait()` is required for read-your-own-writes.\n\nDrive-by: typo fix `chose` → `choose` in `GetMetrics`.\n\nNo code behavior changed.",
