          "id": "a8858d8e3aae684672b3db3946b8dfd5b818832b",
          "message": "refactor: now, the server object owns the caches (#3167)\n\nSolves\nhttps://github.com/authzed/spicedb/pull/3156#issuecomment-4661748374\n\nRight now, the `caches sync.Map` is a global variable, which means that\nif you try to spin up 2 spicedb servers within the same process (as our\ntests do) and both have caching turned on, a panic will occur. This PR\nfixes that.",
