          "message": "test(lsp): cover arrow RHS multi-match permission branch (#3182)\n\nAdds coverage for the arrowRHSReferenceChain multi-match path\n(len(matches) > 1) across both permission orderings: where the first\nmatching target defines the RHS name as a permission, and where a later\nmatch is a permission while the first is a relation. The former\nexercises the IsPermission branch flagged in #3157 review.\n\nFollow-up to #3157, #2990.",
