          "distinct": true,
          "id": "fe78637442764cab7f35ff6539b20123c83d32c5",
          "message": "fix(mysql): exponential backoff on write retries (#3172) (#3187)\n\n* fix(mysql): add exponential backoff to write retry loop (#3172)\n\nConcurrent WriteRelationships touching the same resource could deadlock\n(MySQL error 1213) and then fail with \"max retries exceeded\" because the\nretry loop retried immediately, re-colliding on the same lock contention.\nAdd jittered exponential backoff between retries (matching the Postgres\ndatastore), skipping the sleep after the final attempt.\n\n* refactor(datastore): share SleepOnErr and add mysql deadlock test\n\nMove SleepOnErr into internal/datastore/common so Postgres, CRDB, and\nMySQL share a single implementation instead of duplicating it.\n\nAdd TestMySQLConcurrentWriteDeadlock, which reproduces #3172: 50\nconcurrent writes to the same resource under a low MaxRetries fail on\nmain with 'Error 1213 ... max retries exceeded' and pass with the\nbackoff fix.\n\n* test: make it a shared datastore test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Maria Ines Parnisari <maria.ines.parnisari@authzed.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-23T11:34:34-07:00",
