          "distinct": true,
          "id": "81f80eb9fc63660dc507837f0a671c7ec7a904cc",
          "message": "fix(datastore): return descriptive, engine-agnostic errors instead of raw driver errors\n\nRaw datastore driver errors could leak engine internals (SQLSTATE codes,\nopaque COPY wrappers, CockroachDB retry-internal text) to clients.\n\n- services: unhandled Postgres/MySQL driver errors are sanitized in the\n  error-rewrite path into descriptive, engine-agnostic gRPC statuses, with\n  the full error logged server-side.\n- datastore/postgres: an aborted bulk COPY now surfaces the relationship\n  source's own error instead of the driver's opaque COPY wrapper.\n- datastore/crdb: the retry pool's ResettableError/RetryableError no longer\n  embed the raw driver message (with SQLSTATE) in their gRPC status; they\n  return an engine-agnostic Unavailable message while the full error is\n  still logged. CockroachDB uses the pgx driver, so bare and MaxRetryError\n  wrapped errors are already sanitized via the Postgres path.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-01T12:44:48-07:00",
          "tree_id": "c193ab12fd6fd01b24504bfac9a13b32bf81b7e1",
          "url": "https://github.com/authzed/spicedb/commit/81f80eb9fc63660dc507837f0a671c7ec7a904cc"
